# Generated Files

`dist/**` and `cloud/python-policy.mjs` are generated. Do not hand-edit them.

Change their source, then regenerate:

```sh
node local/build-function-docs.mjs
npm run build
```

Commit regenerated output together with the source change so the two never drift.
